<title>SWEDEN: Nordbanken places $100 mln subordinated loan in US.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken places $100 mln subordinated loan in US.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Nordbanken said on Tuesday it had placed a $100 million 10-year subordinated loan, mainly in the U.S. market.</p>
<p>The loan has a coupon of 7.25 percent over its lifetime. The placement had mainly been made with major American institutional investors and insurance companies, Nordbanken said in a statement.</p>
<p>This was the first loan of this type Nordbanken has placed in the U.S., the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
